{"id":"n74355-3-7","stage":2,"title":"생생하다 · 鲜活","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74355-3-7-1","ko":"나는 이 그림이 사진인 줄 알았어.","zh":"我原来以为这幅画是照片呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이","audio":"/audio/342ddbc2cfa82085a895.mp3"}},{"text":"사진인","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진인","audio":"/audio/7dd2e673fd6d22e82e13.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示所理解的情况（-ㄴ 줄 알다：以为……）","explanation":"줄：表示所理解的情况（-ㄴ 줄 알다：以为……）。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示所理解的情况（-ㄴ 줄 알다：以为……）","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示所理解的情况（-ㄴ 줄 알다：以为……）","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f71af1e03eb1f5329f46.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74355-3-7-2","ko":"정말 생생하게 사진처럼 표현을 했네.","zh":"画得真生动，简直就像照片一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"생생하게","meaning":"鲜活，水灵","explanation":"생생하다：鲜活，水灵；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"생생하다","audio":"/audio/834002c619a1388a4594.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74355","senseId":"3","lemma":"생생하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생생하게","audio":"/audio/4bd89a9308ff2557ed0c.mp3"}},{"text":"사진처럼","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진처럼","audio":"/audio/e0ee043c5ff6745d473f.mp3"}},{"text":"표현을","meaning":"表达，表示，表述","explanation":"표현：表达，表示，表述；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"표현","audio":"/audio/7a2560172c8c2df91b9c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62402","senseId":"1","lemma":"표현","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표현을","audio":"/audio/66caebde5f4056515fbb.mp3"}},{"text":"했네.","meaning":"做、进行（표현을 하다：表现、表达）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（표현을 하다：表现、表达）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했네","audio":"/audio/880bf56268fff2f5d3da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"834002c619a1388a","term":"생생하다","zh":"鲜活，水灵","audio":"/audio/834002c619a1388a4594.mp3","entryId":"74355","definition":"色彩等明亮清新。","pronunciation":["생생하다"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"7a2560172c8c2df9","term":"표현","zh":"表达，表示，表述","audio":"/audio/7a2560172c8c2df91b9c.mp3","entryId":"62402","definition":"通过语言、文字、肢体动作等把感觉或想法等表现出来。","pronunciation":["표현"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（표현을 하다：表现、表达）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（표현을 하다：表现、表达）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a7648237ee9d6c385eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74355","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["画得真生动，简直就像照片一样。","我原来以为这幅画是照片呢。","听说你也去医院看过，感冒怎么还没好啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我原来以为这幅画是照片呢。","听说你也去医院看过，感冒怎么还没好啊？","画得真生动，简直就像照片一样。"],"answer":2}]}
